      "items": [
        "Shard router: With a naive hash % N, changing N would reshuffle almost everything.",
        "Shard A: Picking the wrong shard key creates overloaded “hot shards”.",
        "Shard B: Queries that cross several shards (scatter-gather) become costly.",
        "Shard C: Some cross-shard analytical queries stay hard: they often go to a separate system."
